{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0363_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a905341b8a79c5cee54712281a2e7b86b0d7813e47be989ff560d6763201212a", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\n着替え終わったまつりがやってきたが……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》。\n换好衣服的茉莉过来了，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0363_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "d57157c3ba95d03d385896d15254f0692c4665571b0ca4aff6879fd12036ecb7", "ja": "はいほー、{$P$}さん。\nヒツジさんが1匹、ヒツジさんが2匹……。", "zh": "嗨哟——，{$P$}先生。\n1只小羊，2只小羊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0363_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a00141c2746e823cc90ce6ce577f8afae1cfde4e6ae346c93a2674810c81ec7c", "ja": "まつり……？\n羊なんか数えて、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "茉莉……？\n数羊呢，这是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0363_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "8f76368f96db17d815cde28db82c8de1a65706c447492c72fbd86b707745c9ee", "ja": "ほ？　何も感じないのです？\n姫のこと、もっとよく見てほしいのです。", "zh": "咦？什么都感觉不到吗？\n希望你能更仔细地看看公主哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0363_1004_p", "source_sha256": "689c37a64b295b3f389b73ac9d1d5000bf927bf95150bb7227d4ed2a43afbbc4", "ja": "もっとよく見る？\nじーっ……。", "zh": "要看得更仔细？  \n盯——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0363_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3deaddd9a216a0452e92b34b33eac0fd4360dc7ab5d551e439963cc78d410ba6", "ja": "ああ、わかった！　パジャマが似合ってるな！\n素材の柔らかさが、まつりの雰囲気にピッタリだ。", "zh": "啊，明白了！这身睡衣很适合你啊！\n面料的柔软感，和茉莉的气质非常相称。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0363_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "97174a91d0240162334cff9777c721218637a1ad0712222e4051c0586389f397", "ja": "それはそれで嬉しいのですが……違うのです！\n今のまつりは、癒しぱわー！に溢れてるのです♪", "zh": "这么说我也很开心……但不是这个意思！  \n现在的祭，可是充满治愈力量的哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0363_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "38ffde3c47c4f9cdbd930a4976ef245f3e24be6ee491a61809f491d9ebc01f7c", "ja": "癒やされませんか？　ヒツジさんが3匹～、\nヒツジさんが4匹……みんなでメーメーなのです♪", "zh": "是不是觉得很治愈呢？小羊有3只～，小羊有4只……大家一起咩咩叫～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0363_1008_p", "source_sha256": "266b845c0ab25d14ce5ebec226cc8117011701964ed7cbc6314b060454875113", "ja": "羊を数えると癒やしパワーがでるのか？\n確かにまつりを見てると、癒されるかも？", "zh": "数羊就能产生治愈的力量吗？不过，确实，看着茉莉也许就能得到治愈？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0363_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "a7d9364259dc6f6457769bef91c4ce16e1325beffb0bf221437002db706560f6", "ja": "その調子なのです♪　どんどん姫を見るのですよ。\nヒツジさんが5匹～、ヒツジさんが6匹～……。", "zh": "就是这个劲头♪ 要一直看着公主哦。\n小羊有5只～，小羊有6只～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0363_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "f358df528e81037ca89b54821e6bd60672211069db11c0d2a41efdb8d5803c3b", "ja": "たくさんのヒツジさんにメーメー囲まれて、\nだんだん眠くなるのです～……。", "zh": "被好多咩咩叫的小羊围着，就会渐渐困起来哦～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0363_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b4f38ff1d1e5d42bfacefb33296ba544b87e63fe8d14404fc79021648c001c2f", "ja": "たくさんの羊か。ふわふわして気持ちよさそうだな。\n……ふわぁ～。なんだか眠気が。", "zh": "这么多羊啊。看起来软绵绵的，感觉会很舒服。\n……呼啊～不知怎么的，开始犯困了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0363_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "61d41f09c379e45f5e4bc885442a9ee0aa3a25e779fc221781c57406da749c06", "ja": "姫は知っているのですよ。{$P$}\nさんは徹夜明けでここにいることを。", "zh": "公主可是知道的哦。知道{$P$}\n先生是通宵之后才来这里的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0363_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "ad1158b9ae32be74347d19e16cc73873988db7cda3fd19c0fbe5ceb3b51d6384", "ja": "撮影が始まるまで、まだ時間はあるのです。\n少しくらい眠っても大丈夫なのですよ♪", "zh": "距离开始拍摄还有时间。\n稍微睡一会儿也没关系哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0363_1014_p", "source_sha256": "98d3d5377b65832b497ac3f261432760a6788aeea4b141ea77208db359fb15ec", "ja": "い、いや……仕事中に寝るのはダメだ！\nふわぁ……くっ、あくびが止まらない。", "zh": "不、不行……工作时间不能睡觉！\n哈啊……唔，根本停不下来的哈欠。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0363_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "8f6c891acb82bdabdccf783e77bb852cd7aae6a41357144f041319bae53001b2", "ja": "ふふっ♪　無理をしては、めっ！なのです。\nヒツジさんが7匹～、ヒツジさんが8匹～……。", "zh": "嘻嘻♪ 逞强可是不行的哦！\n小羊有7只～，小羊有8只～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0363_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d7633aaa9afe2288ba50bbf7ba79a394b60ed80dac415525df8b5d0ff4393d2b", "ja": "ま、まつり。それ以上は……。\nうう、だんだん、まぶたが……。", "zh": "呃、茉莉。别再继续了……  \n呜，眼皮渐渐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0363_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "92e79a909ec9ebe53ab8b4a29a7498450e61643da2b0b667dcb0023a176eef61", "ja": "ヒツジさんが9匹～、ヒツジさんが10匹～♪\n時間になったら、ちゃんと起こしてあげるのです。", "zh": "小羊有9只～，小羊有10只～♪  \n时间到了，我会好好叫醒你的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0363_1018_p", "source_sha256": "c018acfed7b7757bc707d41e2ada6f436a3bb0d6f78cf9b27bac044f35d14de3", "ja": "なんだか頭もボーっとして……。\nちょっとだけ……休ませて……もらおう、かな……。", "zh": "总觉得脑袋也昏昏沉沉的……\n就稍微……休息一下……吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0363_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "584306ea149d5c780b5a49cb863380adac9e090e104e46592e852e66518f2c8a", "ja": "はいなのです。……今はゆっくり眠ってね。\nおやすみなさい、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "好的。……现在就好好睡一觉吧。\n晚安，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
